Package: r8pkgDoc
Title: Test Package Documenting R8 Declarations with roxygen2
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("E.D.", "Gennatas", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "gennatas@gmail.com")
Description: Declares R8 types, traits, and impls documented by roxygen2
    blocks, for the tests of R8. Its NAMESPACE and Rd files are generated by
    roxygen2::roxygenise() with the roclet R8::r8_rd.
License: BSD_3_clause + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    R8
Config/R8/namespace: pkgdoc
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE, roclets = c("collate", "namespace", "R8::r8_rd"))
